BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (Section 301, HMF, MPF, marking duties, IRS taxes and 201 duties. Harper also flags that MPF minimums and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (maximums require special math [NK99CBNOeJA @ 00:06:34]. The Scarbrough webinar team adds voluntary tender) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (and prior disclosure duties to the list, and describes Section 301 recovery as getting 'that 25 percent back') Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm ([6Ogi9iKVSTE @ 00:19:43]. The exclusion list is just as uniform: AD/CVD, Section 232 and over-quota agricultural) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (duties do not come back. Aaron Mandelbaum of Thompson Hine extends the line into the newest tariffs. IEEPA) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (reciprocal duties fall on the eligible side and IEEPA fentanyl tariffs on the ineligible side, while some 232 carve-outs) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (are starting to emerge [WqGvMD-AOqg @ 00:11:23]. The operating consensus is blunt. Before modeling any refund,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (strip 232, AD/CVD and over-quota lines out of the duty base, because no claim structure recovers them. The 301, 201,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (MPF and HMF lines stay in the recoverable pool that the rest of the program is built around.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (Substitution is where the consensus sharpens into hard classification rules. Scarbrough Global describes the old) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm ('commercially interchangeable' test, which weighed four factors: government or industry standards, part numbers, tariff) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (classifications and relative value. They call it unwieldy and subjective, while the TFTEA standard is a much more) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (objective 8-digit HTS match [fI28fmPlbPA @ 00:01:39]. Their commingled-bin customer illustrates the upside. That) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (customer sources the same item from four countries plus a domestic supplier and still substitutes, as long as it is not an) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (other provision. The rule set repeats everywhere. If the 8-digit line is an 'other' provision, drop to the 10-digit code, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (if the 10-digit code is also 'other', substitution is barred [6Ogi9iKVSTE @ 00:14:47]. Alliance Duty Drawback Services) Tj ET
